        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "386ba5d3-50a2-5abc-a03e-639a196eca5b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Lord, Christopher Miller, Chris McKay, Jorge Blanco, Joe Stillman, Judi Barrett, Ron Barrett, Dwayne Johnson, Jessica Biel, Justin Long, Gary Oldman, Seann William Scott, John Cleese\n- Products: Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs, Planet 51, The Lego Movie, 21 Jump Street\n- Topics: animated films, science fiction comedy films, children's books\n\nFacts:\n- Judi Barrett and Ron Barrett wrote the 1978 children's book Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs.\n- Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs is a 2009 American computer-animated science fiction comedy film loosely based on the 1978 children's book of the same name by Judi and Ron Barrett.\n- Planet 51 is a 2009 Spanish and American-British 3D computer-animated science fiction comedy film directed by Jorge Blanco, written by Joe Stillman, and starring Dwayne Johnson, Jessica Biel, Justin Long, Gary Oldman, Seann William Scott, and John Cleese.\n- Phil Lord and Christopher Miller are known for directing and writing the 2009 animated film Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs.\n- Phil Lord and Christopher Miller directed the 2012 live-action comedy film 21 Jump Street and its 2014 sequel.\n- Phil Lord and Christopher Miller are known for directing and writing the 2014 animated film The Lego Movie.\n- Chris McKay worked as an animation co-director on The Lego Movie in 2014 with Phil Lord and Christopher Miller.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
